  user_1,[00:00] Hi Vikram, I got your reminder about my health policy.
  user_2,[00:05] Hey Sneha, good morning! Yes, the HP‑4478 is set to expire on 30 Sep 2026.
  user_1,[00:12] Uh—just to be clear, that’s this September, right? Not next year?
  user_2,[00:18] Exactly, this September. I’ve already sent the renewal docs and we applied the 5 % loyalty discount, so the new premium is $199.50 per month.
  user_1,[00:27] Right, I saw the email. I’m good with that. So the old policy will be marked as expired on the 30th?
  user_2,[00:34] Yep, once the renewal takes effect, the current policy will switch to “Expired” status on 30 Sep 2026 and the new term starts 01 Oct 2026.
  user_1,[00:42] Got it. Do I need to do anything else? Maybe a signature?
  user_2,[00:48] No further action needed; the e‑signature we got in the email is enough. I’ll update the system now.
  user_1,[00:55] Thanks, Vikram. Appreciate the help. [sighs of relief]